---
description: every message arrow, solid and dotted
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A
  participant B
  A->B: solid, no head
  A-->B: dotted, no head
  A->>B: solid, arrowhead
  A-->>B: dotted, arrowhead
  A<<->>B: solid, both heads
  A<<-->>B: dotted, both heads
  A-xB: solid, cross
  A--xB: dotted, cross
  A-)B: solid, async
  A--)B: dotted, async
